      "hash64": "3130DC5AA9E6D958",
      "text": "J’écoute !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "3130DF5AA9E6DE71",
      "text": "Je n’écoute pas !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "E6DB38293EA35109",
      "text": "C’est trop d’émotions !\\nJe ne sais pas par quoi commencer ![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_01b",
      "hash64": "E9D1D9156F8358D1",
      "text": "Qu’est-ce qui te prend ? Tu me fais marcher ?\\nTant pis, je vais quand même tout te raconter ![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "E6DB35293EA34BF0",
      "text": "Tu te souviens du centre d’exploitation\\nde ressources sous-marines dont je t’ai parlé ?\\r\\nCelui qui se trouve sous l’institut ?\\c\\nEh bien, j’y suis allée, et c’était hallucinant ![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 181,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "E6DB36293EA34DA3",
      "text": "Tu veux savoir comment j’ai réussi à y aller ?\\c\\nEn fait, j’étais à l’entrée de l’institut quand\\nsoudain, un vieux monsieur m’a interpellée...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "E6DB3B293EA35622",
      "text": "Il portait un beau costume blanc, comme un\\ngentleman, et il m’a dit avec un grand sourire\\r\\nqu’il pouvait me montrer le centre.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "E6DB3C293EA357D5",
      "text": "Je me demande qui c’était, ce monsieur...\\nUne sorte de génie qui exauce les souhaits ?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_select_03",
      "hash64": "3130DE5AA9E6DCBE",
      "text": "Oui, peut-être !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_select_04",
      "hash64": "3130E15AA9E6E1D7",
      "text": "Je pense que c’était le directeur...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "E6DB39293EA352BC",
      "text": "Tu penses ? C’est vrai qu’il avait une aura\\nun peu spéciale... Je suis sûre que c’est ça !\\c\\nOh là là ! Il faut que j’en apprenne plus\\nsur ce « génie » ![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 154,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_06b",
      "hash64": "E9D4FF156F85CF3A",
      "text": "Quoi ? C’est lui, le directeur ? Ça alors,\\nil a l’air aussi étrange que notre proviseur.\\c\\nC’est une condition pour être à la tête\\nd’une école, ou quoi ?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 154,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "4E17A931A687F130",
      "text": "Il est vraiment fascinant, cet institut ! J’adore !\\nQuand je pense que j’ai hésité à venir...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "4E17AA31A687F2E3",
      "text": "Bon, je n’ai pas trouvé de cadeau pour te\\nremercier de m’avoir invitée, mais à la place...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "4E17AB31A687F496",
      "text": "Tu ne voudrais pas qu’on échange des Pokémon ?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "4E17AC31A687F649",
      "text": "OK ! Je te propose l’un de mes meilleurs\\nVolivoli ! Qu’est-ce que tu me donnes, toi ?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "4E17AD31A687F7FC",
      "text": "Hmmm... Ça te ressemble bien de me donner\\nun Pokémon comme [VAR 0x0101(0001)].\\c\\nJe le garderai toujours près de moi.\\nTu verras, je vais bien m’en occuper ![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
